  "description": "The Apollo is our answer to a simple question: why should gravel riding come with extra hassle?Built around Priority’s low-maintenance promise, the Apollo replaces traditional drivetrains with a Gates Belt and sealed internally geared hub, delivering smooth, quiet, and reliable rides without grease, grime, or constant tuning.\nAvailable in flat bar, drop bar, and titanium drop bar, the Apollo platform is designed to adapt to how — and where — you ride. From daily commutes and errands to gravel detours and mixed-surface routes, the Apollo is always ready for liftoff.\nKey highlights include:\n\nLightweight aluminum or titanium frame options designed for mixed-terrain riding\n\nFull carbon fork for vibration damping and weight savings\n\nPowerful disc brakes for confident stopping in all conditions\n\nMultiple mounting points for racks, fenders, bottles, and bags\n\nClimb-friendly gearing that handles rolling terrain with ease\n\nHouston… there are no problems here.With no derailleurs to knock out of alignment, no chains to grease, and no cassettes to clog with dirt, the Apollo shrugs off weather, grit, and everyday wear. When the ride’s over, a quick rinse is usually all it takes to get ready for the next mission.\nNo matter how you ride — pavement, gravel, city streets, or everything in between — the Apollo is cleared for launch.",
